:INHERIT after a field :DECLARE (diag.inherit_position, error): SSL only
accepts :INHERIT directly after the class declaration. The misplaced
:INHERIT is not class_member_order's finding (issue #255 split).
-- input.ssl --
:CLASS Widget;
:DECLARE nWidth;
:INHERIT Lab.Control;

:PROCEDURE Init;
	Base:Init();
	Me:nWidth := 100;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:CLASS Widget;
:DECLARE nWidth;
:INHERIT Lab.Control;

:PROCEDURE Init;
	Base:Init();
	Me:nWidth := 100;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
3:1-3:9 error inherit_position: ':INHERIT' must directly follow the ':CLASS' statement
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
3:1-3:9 error inherit_position: ':INHERIT' must directly follow the ':CLASS' statement
